 <!-- advc.008c: Let's not be so dramatic about enemy spies -->
 <TEXT>
 	<Tag>TXT_KEY_HINT_52</Tag>
 	<English>If you spend more Espionage Points than an opponent, your missions towards that opponent get cheaper. Every point you spend throughout the game is added to this total. By increasing your Espionage spending, you also make it costlier for rivals to conduct missions against you.</English>
