 <!-- advc.008c: An opportunity to point out Civ4lerts. -->
 <TEXT>
 	<Tag>TXT_KEY_HINT_13</Tag>
 	<English>Check the foreign advisor often - knowing what your friends (and foes) can offer in trade is valuable information. The BUG mod can alert you whenever a technology or resource becomes available for trade; see the "Alerts" tab of the BUG menu.</English>
